@startuml nfc-ble-flow
' NFC + BLE P2P 分享交互时序图
' 导出: plantuml -tpng -scale 2 nfc-ble-flow.puml

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2.5
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam maxmessagesize 220
skinparam boxPadding 16
skinparam participantPadding 60
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

' 参与者配色
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #3B82F6
  FontColor #1E3A5F
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #F3E8FF
  BorderColor #9333EA
  FontColor #4C1D95
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #F59E0B
  FontColor #78350F
  FontSize 11
}

' 自定义样式
<style>
  participant {
    FontSize 13
  }
  actor {
    FontSize 13
  }
</style>

title **NFC + BLE 碰一碰分享 — 完整交互流程**
footer 智能错题本 · NFC + BLE P2P 分享

actor "**发送端**\n(Sender)" as S  #DBEAFE
participant "NFC Tag" as N  #F3E8FF
actor "**接收端**\n(Receiver)" as R  #DBEAFE

|||
hnote over S #EBF5FF: **阶段一: 发送端准备数据**
|||

S -> S: **1. 组装 SharePayload**\nNfcShareCodec.encode()
S -> S: **2. BLE 广播启动**\nBleShareTransport.startAdvertising(data)

hnote over S #FEF3C7: GATT Server 已就绪
note over S #FFF7ED: Read Characteristic · payload\ndata\nWrite Characteristic · ACK

|||
hnote over R #EBF5FF: **阶段二: NFC 感应唤醒**
|||

R -> N: **NFC 碰触**
activate N
N -> R: 3. extractNfcTextPayload()
deactivate N

R -> R: **4. BLE 扫描启动**\npublishIncomingPayload() →\nBleShareTransport.startScanning()

|||
hnote over S,R #EBF5FF: **阶段三: BLE 连接与数据传输**
|||

R -> S: **5. 连接 & 服务发现**\nconnectGatt() → discoverServices()
S --> R: **返回 payload data**\nreadCharacteristic()

R -> R: **6. 解析 & 入库**\nNfcShareCodec.decode(data)\n↓\ninsert QuestionEntity(s)

|||
hnote over S,R #EBF5FF: **阶段四: ACK 确认**
|||

R -> S: **7. 发送 ACK**\nwriteCharacteristic(ACK, sessionId)
activate S #E0F2FE
S -> S: **8. 确认收到**\nonAckReceived()\n状态 → Completed
deactivate S

@enduml
